          "body": "### Bug Fixes\n\n* **git:** count native ahead/behind after the walk ([d01ca02](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/d01ca021d6ceb899e252884f3a95db5969a4b8fd)), closes [#7954](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/issues/7954)\n* **ipify:** use the configured url ([a03f7f6](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/a03f7f6deec4f179a9662aab4e90b34cbbe6ff27))\n* **studio:** retry font loading after PNG export failures ([8cb54a7](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/8cb54a7061a33a7e10c918f4d4caff9e198c2a60))\n\n\n* fix(aspire)!: avoid CLI discovery on every prompt ([11a939e](https://github.com/JanDeDobbeleer/oh-my-posh/commit/11a939ea861d18a73fada9fe777e14098bfdd710))\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* Aspire CLI discovery is now opt-in via fetch_apphost: true;\nfile-based detection remains default.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: b33a5475-612d-4d05-b2df-8d4268d38e45\nCopilot-Session: 766187df-d92b-4296-920c-519cf7892b2d"
